sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 浏览器
    participant Router as Router
    participant Controller as BookController
    participant Service as BookQueryService
    participant Repo as EbookRepository
    participant DB as SQLite

    Client->>Router: GET /api/books
    Router->>Controller: listBooks(ctx)
    Controller->>Service: getBookList()
    Service->>Repo: findAll()
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM ebooks
    DB-->>Repo: 原始数据
    Repo-->>Service: [Ebook模型]
    Service->>Service: 转换为DTO
    Service-->>Controller: [BookDTO]
    Controller->>Controller: 包装为 {success, data}
    Controller-->>Router: ctx.body
    Router-->>Client: 200 JSON
